<title>CHILE: Chile's CMPC 1996 net falls.</title>
<headline>Chile's CMPC 1996 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forestry firm Empresas CMPC SA reported the following results for last year.</p>
<p>				  1996		 1995</p>
<p>Net earnings		    42.72		83.70</p>
<p>Operating income		 6.24		41.93</p>
<p>Non-operating income	  46.60		46.58</p>
<p>Total revenues*		  5.37	     154.60</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of Chilean pesos.</p>
<p>*The large drop in revenues was due to the transfer of the company's wood pulp sales from CMPC, the holding company, to a new subsidiary, Celulosa.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212))</p>
